OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFairly mild
OL,6,Ffor most overnight with showery rain
OL,7,Fin places. Turning increasingly wet
OL,8,Facross the Midlands, western England
OL,9,Fand Wales with heavier rain possible
OL,10,Flater. Clearer skies in the far west
OL,11,Fwith pockets of frost and fog in
